{"availability":"available","full":"CodeStitchOfficial/Advanced-Astro-i18n","name":"Advanced-Astro-i18n","description":"This Astro starter kit ships bilingual (English/French) by default, with several pages built from CodeStitch components, a blog powered by Astro's content collections, and Decap CMS pre-wired for content editing. Run the CLI to scaffold your project with only the modules you need!","category":"Developer tools","language":"Astro","stars":65,"forks":25,"created":"2024-06-01T16:41:35Z","updated":"2026-10-11T00:13:34Z","license":"CC0-1.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://advanced-astro-kit-i18n.netlify.app/","topics":["astrojs","i18n","starter-kit"],"demo":"https://advanced-astro-kit-i18n.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:51.140Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:51.140Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:51.140Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:16.039Z","stars":65,"forks":25},{"at":"2026-10-04T19:21:55.099Z","stars":65,"forks":25},{"at":"2026-10-06T21:06:55.067Z","stars":65,"forks":25},{"at":"2026-10-09T01:08:07.393Z","stars":65,"forks":25},{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:05.960Z","stars":65,"forks":25},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:25:51.140Z","stars":65,"forks":25}],"technologies":[],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:51.140Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This Astro starter kit ships bilingual (English/French) by default, with several pages built from CodeStitch components, a blog powered by Astro's content collections, and Decap CMS pre-wired for content editing. Every optional piece — i18n, the CMS, dark mode, demo content — can be stripped out with one interactive script, so the same kit works just as well for single-language projects as multilingual ones.","This kit runs on Astro v7 with reusable components and centralized data, giving you room to scale as a client's site grows. It ships bilingual by default, with internationalization powered by Astro's built-in i18n routing, scalable to as many locales as you need. The blog runs on Decap CMS and Astro's Content Collections.","Every optional feature (i18n, Decap CMS, dark mode, demo content) can be removed with an interactive script (see Commands), so the same kit works just as well for a single-language site as a multilingual one. An example website is included, built from CodeStitch's vanilla component library for easy section swaps — deployment is possible in as little as two minutes."],"features":["Bilingual by default (English/French) with Astro's built-in i18n routing and custom utilities — add more locales anytime","Optional Decap CMS integration for blog management (removable via node scripts/remove-decap.js)","Dark mode (removable via node scripts/remove-dark-mode.js)","Astro's integration for view transitions","Astro's content collections to supercharge your Astro pages and content"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CodeStitchOfficial/Advanced-Astro-i18n/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9213de7d3e5d2815f53faa24e81728e576625b633dd20cfc1cd5ddbd5aaae1dc","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:15:06.645Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:51.225Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T00:13:34Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This Astro starter kit ships bilingual (English/French) by default, with several pages built from CodeStitch components, a blog powered by Astro's content collections, and Decap CMS pre-wired for content editing. Every optional piece — i18n, the CMS, dark mode, demo content — can be stripped out with one interactive script, so the same kit works just as well for single-language projects as multilingual ones.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CodeStitchOfficial/Advanced-Astro-i18n/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Log in with your DecapBridge credentials.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CodeStitchOfficial/Advanced-Astro-i18n/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required",